Subject: [PATCH] chore(manager): one canonical CarCode workspace

The manager identifies the canonical repository and any linked worktree it
runs in (logs, -Status, the task record and the Claude prompt). With
CARCODE_CANONICAL_REPO set, it refuses an independent copy or clone, so a
duplicate folder is never managed as a separate CarCode project.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
